<title>USA: Radius names Mark Housley President/CEO.</title>
<headline>Radius names Mark Housley President/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radius Inc said on Tuesday that it named Mark Housley president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company issued a news release saying Housley had served as company president and chief operating officer, positions he held since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>Chuck Berger, Radius' previous chief executive, will continue as non-executive chairman of the board, the company said.</p>
<p>At the end of the month Berger will join IMGIS Inc as chairman and chief executive, the release said.</p>
</text>
